OL,3,GNEWSAParking firm apologises over
OL,4,Aincorrect charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parking enforcement business has
OL,7,Fapologised to people who were
OL,8,F"incorrectly" charged.
OL,10,FChanges introduced at the East of
OL,11,FEngland Co-op in Framlingham, Suffolk,
OL,12,Fin August, mean customers need to input
OL,13,Ftheir number-plate into a terminal
OL,14,Finside the store for free parking.
OL,16,FIpserv, which administers the charges
OL,17,Fon behalf of the supermarket, said it
OL,18,Fwas aware "a number" of charges were
OL,19,F"issued incorrectly" due to a "fault
OL,20,Fwith one of the customer registration
OL,21,Ftablets".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
